# Plugin API

Docs: `docs/plugins/api.md`, `docs/plugins/ui-contract.md`, schemas in `docs/plugins/schema/`,
example `docs/plugins/examples/media-card.md`.

## Versions

- `PLUGIN_HOST_API_VERSION = 2`, `PLUGIN_MIN_API_VERSION = 1` (`plugin/api/PluginManifest.kt`).
- Never break an accepted version. v1 `WorkDetail` fields (`status`, `rating`, `views`) must keep
  mapping onto the media card (`PluginMediaCardAdapter`).
- A breaking contract change needs a new `apiVersion`, a host bump, and the build script cap in
  `flow-reader-plugins/scripts/build-index.mjs`.

## v2 media card

- Plugins fill slots only: `card.stats` (≤6), `badges` (≤4), `links` (≤3, http(s)),
  `actions` (≤2 rail, ≤2 footer). Caps enforced in `PluginCard.capped()`.
- Host actions are fixed and ordered: list toggles, Share (rail); Download, Refresh, Delete, Read
  (footer). Reserved ids: `read download refresh delete share open remove` and `list:*`.
- Plugin actions → `PluginSource.cardAction(workId, actionId, on?)` → `PluginCardActionResult`
  (`card` patch persisted by `PluginBookStore.runCardAction`, `toast`, `reload`).
- Icon tokens (`FlowIcons.tokens`) are append-only API.

## When changing plugin-visible behavior

1. Update models/parsers in `plugin/api/PluginModels.kt` and tests in `app/src/test/.../plugin/api/`.
2. Update `MediaCardAdapters.kt` + `MediaCardAdaptersTest`.
3. Update `docs/plugins/api.md`, `ui-contract.md`, and the JSON schemas.
4. Update the Node test host and plugins in `../flow-reader-plugins` if they rely on it.

Full cross-repo checklist (version sync, host mirror, release order): `docs/agent/map.md`.
History and open threads: `../flow-reader-chats/areas/plugins.md`.
